{"id":"vod_sn_39199","vodId":"39199","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"我家的女仆太烦人了！","name_cn":"我家的女仆太烦人了！","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3804b4422419571aa7e1c51262ef7a4f.jpg"},"summary":"米夏（白石晴香 配音）是有着一头金发的俄罗斯少女，幼年时，她的母亲因为车祸不幸早早的离开了她，米夏和父亲过着相依为命的生活。为了能够更好的照料米夏，父亲找来了许多的保姆，但是米夏真正希望得到的，是再也无法得到的母爱，因此常常将悲伤和愤怒发泄在这些保姆们身上，导致没有一个保姆能够在米夏身边久留。　　这一次父亲找来的新保姆名叫鸭居燕（沼仓爱美 配音），米夏本以为自己可以故技重施再次作走这个女人，没想到鸭居燕和从前那些手无缚鸡之力的姑娘们不一样，她曾是日本航空自卫队的一等空曹。就这样，米夏和鸭居燕斗智斗勇的日常就这样展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/U0SXyvc6hK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QYb5JjnyiE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/P90LvVWmTm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/5NWma0kenJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A8YuxQLXub1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6bxWh4ACMC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nB6mbhn9uZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/AF62MkMGb11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Mm3QQxuZJv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1Nr5xWWPnj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JG7YQcHTEH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1qZkUCXUmh1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:49.502Z"}